            <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="sparkles-new-features">✨ New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Added compact UI mode</strong></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="wrench-fixes">🔧 Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed mirror widget sizing</li>
<li>Fixed issue where calendar wheel hover recognition prevented gesture
reactivity</li>
<li>Added blur effect on notch open and close</li>
<li>Implemented a potential fix for liquid glass black mask lagging
during notch open animation</li>
<li>Added release notes to update popup in settings</li>
<li>Added airdrop progress HUD toggle to settings</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
